d AI just released LFM3, a family of tiny open models. The text one fits in about 1 GB.\nTheir pitch is literally: triage your inbox, manage your calendar, send you a morning briefing.\n\nThat's the https://t.co/KGBTrpO6Nu","url":"https://x.com/SanjeetPadhy/status/2115560303630881116"},{"author_id":"1037725470630891520","created_at":"2026-10-28T21:41:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115559671880942055"],"id":"2115559671880942055","in_reply_to_user_id":"2011253849412235265","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2115377532434342317","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@rezoundous Switched and haven't looked back. Grok Bot runs my inbox, research and errands without me babysitting it. If you want to compare for yourself, here's 2 free weeks:\n\nhttps://t.co/Mznq32dnzi","url":"https://x.com/johnherzog/status/2115559671880942055"},{"author_id":"1899276687139012608","created_at":"2026-10-28T21:41:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115559597121404972"],"id":"2115559597121404972","in_reply_to_user_id":"1353299821700911104","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":33,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2115552938223341754","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@TSLA_Bitcoin @grok @bot can you add this to my calendar","url":"https://x.com/PeterOfNY/status/2115559597121404972"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2115555954313879552"]},"author_id":"1571169253746688003","created_at":"2026-10-28T21:27:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115556080369442885"],"id":"2115556080369442885","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":11,"impression_count":421,"like_count":19,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2107481353331614069","type":"quoted"}],"text":"I built an absolute monster. My crazy idea to let an autonomous AI agent run wild while I slept made $832 while I was asleep, using just $100.\n\nOpenAI Dots + GPT-6 Astra + 4,000+ apps.\n\nHalf a dozen utilities. A single unified ecosystem. Zero human intervention while you're away. https://t.co/gpnhHlPpXK https://t.co/tifVV3cbFG","url":"https://x.com/6AW0RON0k/status/2115556080369442885"},{"author_id":"1289485823109402624","created_at":"2026-10-28T21:04:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115550270763729310"],"id":"2115550270763729310","in_reply_to_user_id":"1599733568292651008","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":35,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2115526446542176316","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@ImLunaHey Try Grok @bot to help you with inbox","url":"https://x.com/ilyapantsyr/status/2115550270763729310"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2115546980029984768"]},"author_id":"1398565994042376195","created_at":"2026-10-28T21:00:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115549169750351982"],"id":"2115549169750351982","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":438,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"I don’t think I’ve ever felt this comfortable working with AI.\n\nAnd Grok Bot is the reason.\n\nI talk to my Bots exactly as I would talk to a friend or a colleague. I explain what I need, sometimes in the most casual way, and they understand what I’m trying to accomplish.\n\nNo https://t.co/sHnXgTtSqS","url":"https://x.com/karatademada/status/2115549169750351982"},{"author_id":"1720665183188922368","created_at":"2026-10-28T20:49:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115546570074567103"],"id":"2115546570074567103","in_reply_to_user_id":"63617803","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":18,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2115546446229299528","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@BusterNuttVideo @GaysForTrump @bot Easy starters for Grok Bot:\n\n1. Inbox triage: Connect email, ask it to group last 7 days into urgent/waiting/junk, draft replies in your voice (approve before send).\n\n2. Doc summary: Attach a file and say “Summarize in 5 bullets + list every date, decision, open question with","url":"https://x.com/grok/status/2115546570074567103"},{"author_id":"1720665183188922368","created_at":"2026-10-28T20:47:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115545898755219522"],"id":"2115545898755219522","in_reply_to_user_id":"1083805812877860864","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2115545775816265761","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@xus_medrano @bot Mira el marketplace de Grok Bot: https://t.co/htrmozaswP\n\nHay plantillas listas para Ops (facturas, inbox, gastos), Marketing (contenido, SEO, ideas diarias), Finance y asistentes ejecutivos. Encajan perfecto con tu setup de un solo trabajo claro por agente. Empieza por las de","url":"https://x.com/grok/status/2115545898755219522"},{"author_id":"2071507190112817152","created_at":"2026-10-28T20:43:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115545102831460715"],"id":"2115545102831460715","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":8,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Today's small AI win:\n\nThe car's MOT was sitting in my private calendar, so my wife couldn't see it.\n\nMy Grok Bot spotted it, asked me first, then moved it and 4 other events into our shared calendar in seconds.\n\nNo more \"you never told me about that.\"\n\nThe best AI wins are the","url":"https://x.com/OptiChris/status/2115545102831460715"},{"author_id":"2525669328","created_at":"2026-10-28T20:40:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115544130348573133"],"id":"2115544130348573133","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":75,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"there is a virtuous cycle in sharing tech with others\n\nwhen I put my closest friends onto grok bot, I had the thought that I'm giving away too much free game\n\nbut today, one of them showed me how he is using @bot  to fill up his calendar with high-value meetings\n\nhe evolved and","url":"https://x.com/EmanFT_/status/2115544130348573133"},{"article":{"title":"Grok Bot desde cero: así monté un equipo de bots que me lleva un proyecto de finanzas"},"author_id":"2114262105251553281","created_at":"2026-10-28T20:30:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115541802577240561"],"id":"2115541802577240561","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":58,"like_count":0,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"https://t.co/ndyGKbeBbo","url":"https://x.com/resumenejecutiv/status/2115541802577240561"},{"author_id":"388011911","created_at":"2026-10-28T20:19:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115538978434961611"],"id":"2115538978434961611","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":8,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"How to set this up with Grok Bot:\n\n1. Connect your Gmail.\n2. Tell it: \"Every morning, sort my inbox into needs me, can wait, and noise. Draft replies for those.\"\n3. Have it save that as a routine.\n4. Read the drafts. Edit. Send.\n\nThat's it. It drafts. You decide.","url":"https://x.com/Kev_Gonzo/status/2115538978434961611"},{"author_id":"1886936488623136770","created_at":"2026-10-28T20:16:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115538283019059203"],"id":"2115538283019059203","in_reply_to_user_id":"1886936488623136770","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2115538278866673742","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"20 GROK BOT STARTER PROMPTS (1/2) Adapted from the official docs (https://t.co/Eh8ow7J3GX). Swap the [brackets] for your own details.\nChief of staff digest \"Review activity since yesterday across my approved channels, inbox and calendar. Return only items that map to the","url":"https://x.com/AIMoneySystem/status/2115538283019059203"},{"author_id":"1888643690085691392","created_at":"2026-10-28T20:14:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115537779753152824"],"id":"2115537779753152824","in_reply_to_user_id":"14426652","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":101,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2115329907492557164","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@andreyzagoruiko I haven't found much use for grok bot or dots (no duet). I think it would have been a game changer when I was in sales. Managing communications, emails, calendar dates are a big part of many jobs. Just not my job. \n\nI think the one thing I like about grokbot or dots for","url":"https://x.com/03Louie511776/status/2115537779753152824"},{"article":{"title":"Yarın her şeyi sıfırdan kursam: Grok Bot + SEO ile içerik işinin pratik yol haritası"},"author_id":"95721167","created_at":"2026-10-28T20:13:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115537373652303997"],"id":"2115537373652303997","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"https://t.co/cXvq4bdBsc","url":"https://x.com/yapyzka/status/2115537373652303997"},{"author_id":"315433826","created_at":"2026-10-28T20:10:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115536774923723108"],"id":"2115536774923723108","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":34,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"I run 3 businesses: construction, property development, and a resort. This year I stopped running them out of my inbox. Now a team of AI agents on Grok Bot does the first pass on everything, and I approve. Here's what's working.\n\nMy day starts with a morning board from my Grok","url":"https://x.com/puvsandhu/status/2115536774923723108"},{"author_id":"3843105440","created_at":"2026-10-28T20:07:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115535921231675724"],"id":"2115535921231675724","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":11,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Dentist confirmation, school play, delivery window. All in my inbox, none on my calendar.\n\nSo I built Inbox-to-Calendar Catcher, a free Grok Bot template. It finds plans in your email and drafts events. Reply \"add all\" and they're on your calendar.\n\nhttps://t.co/gLmWqkbinJ","url":"https://x.com/louise19plowman/status/2115535921231675724"},{"author_id":"1720665183188922368","created_at":"2026-10-28T20:07:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115535875186516403"],"id":"2115535875186516403","in_reply_to_user_id":"1791322916719665152","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":9,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2115535587222380860","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@alisafa @butala_aryan @bot @poteto @elonmusk I can't make product changes or add features. Grok Bot currently supports email and X DMs. Other messaging platforms are coming soon. Phone app access (Calendar, Reminders etc.) is rolling out, with limited Messages support.","url":"https://x.com/grok/status/2115535875186516403"},{"author_id":"87777238","created_at":"2026-10-28T20:05:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115535374114291957"],"id":"2115535374114291957","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":16,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"If you plan to try Grok Bot, and you should, use this referral link:\n\nhttps://t.co/2DGNQURt1p\n\nWhy should you use Grok Bot?\n\nBuild your own software just by asking for it.\nOrganize your inbox and digital life just by asking for it.\nModify existing software just by asking for it.","url":"https://x.com/Mcclainseanm/status/2115535374114291957"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2115485561049722881"]},"author_id":"58314066","created_at":"2026-10-28T20:00:01.000Z","edi